@startuml
title Get Order Details (with joined Customer and Inventory Info)

actor Client
participant "Orders Service" as Orders
participant "Customer Service" as Customer
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory

Client -> Orders : GET /orders/{serialNumber}\n(e.g., request order details)
Orders -> Customer : GET /customers?mobileNumber={mobileNumber}
activate Customer
Customer --> Orders : CustomerDetailsDto
deactivate Customer

Orders -> Inventory : GET /inventory?serialNumber={serialNumber}
activate Inventory
Inventory --> Orders : InventoryDto
deactivate Inventory

Orders --> Client : OrderDetailsDto\n(includes customer & inventory info)
@enduml